  "description": "I came to Yulguk in Wonderland with a friend who said she was a princess in my previous life...Weird. There is an imperial palace in my memory, and seeing the emperor makes my heart pound. \n\n“I like you a lot.\"   \n“Hey, no, your Majesty. It’s different from just now.”   \n\"No. I definitely like you, Yulgi. I want and crave you But this heart is ambiguous for love.”\n\nEventually sparked a debate over who was the actual princess, and we were put to the test. By the way… Oh My God. \n\n“What is that? What is it, Yulgi-kun?” \n\nMy previous life wasn't a princess, it was the cat that the princess's brother had!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/come_here_butler), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/wlqtkzjaz), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51910095), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3824000165), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3556391)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/2880/), Vietnamese, Russian, Spanish",
